@startuml objects
title MixP Toolbox 0.1.2 — 对象图（保存修改前的示例快照）
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial Unicode MS"

object "window : Window" as WindowObject {
  window_ = <运行时 HWND>
  tooltips_ = <运行时 HWND>
  selected_ = 0
  scope_ = AllFiles
  sourceFilter_ = -1
  loading_ = false
  dirty_ = true
  creating_ = false
  object_ = "*"
}

object "store : mixp::RegistryStore" as StoreObject {
  userRoot_ = HKEY_CURRENT_USER
  machineRoot_ = HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE
  userPrefix_ = "Software\Classes"
  machinePrefix_ = "Software\Classes"
  backupDirectory_ = <用户本地应用数据目录>\MixpToolbox\backups
}

object "entryList : std::vector<Entry>" as EntriesObject {
  size = 1
}

object "joeEntry : mixp::Entry" as EntryObject {
  source = CurrentUser
  object = "*"
  verb = "Mixp.Joe"
  label = "使用 JOE 编辑"
  command = "D:\Tools\joe\joe.exe" -colors darkblue2 -tab 4 "%1"
  labelType = REG_SZ
  commandType = REG_SZ
  enabled = true
  extended = false
  editable = true
}

object "menuSnapshot : mixp::Tree" as SnapshotObject {
  name = ""
  values.size = 1
  children.size = 1
}

object "labelValue : mixp::Value" as LabelObject {
  name = ""
  type = REG_SZ
  bytes.size = 20
  bytes = UTF-16LE("使用 JOE 编辑" + NUL)
}

object "commandNode : mixp::Tree" as CommandTreeObject {
  name = "command"
  values.size = 1
  children.size = 0
}

object "commandValue : mixp::Value" as CommandValueObject {
  name = ""
  type = REG_SZ
  bytes.size = 106
  bytes = UTF-16LE(joeEntry.command + NUL)
}

object "draft : mixp::Draft" as DraftObject {
  source = CurrentUser
  object = "*"
  verb = "Mixp.Joe"
  label = "使用 JOE 编辑"
  command = "D:\Tools\joe\joe.exe" -colors darkblue2 -tab 8 "%1"
  enabled = true
  extended = false
  expandEnvironment = false
}

WindowObject --> StoreObject : store_（引用，不拥有）
WindowObject *-- EntriesObject : entries_（成员）
EntriesObject *-- EntryObject : [0]（按值存储）
EntryObject *-- SnapshotObject : snapshot（成员）
SnapshotObject *-- LabelObject : values[0]
SnapshotObject *-- CommandTreeObject : children[0]
CommandTreeObject *-- CommandValueObject : values[0]
WindowObject ..> DraftObject : IDC_SAVE 处理中的局部变量
DraftObject ..> EntryObject : update(joeEntry, draft)

note top of WindowObject
  示例时刻：用户已将 -tab 4 改为 -tab 8 并点击保存；
  Draft 已从控件构建，尚未调用 store_.update()。
  为简化展示，假设 entries_ 中只有此一个菜单项。
end note

note bottom of SnapshotObject
  snapshot() 返回的根 Tree.name 保持为空，
  子树的 name 才记录对应子键名称。
  当前快照没有 LegacyDisable 和 Extended 值，
  所以 enabled=true、extended=false。
end note

note bottom of DraftObject
  Draft 表示用户准备保存的新内容，
  Entry.snapshot 仍保留查询时读取的旧内容。
  图中名称、路径和数据为示例，不是实际注册表采集结果。
  bytes 按 UTF-16LE 语义展示，而非完整十六进制字节列表。
end note
@enduml
